@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiVersion = 1.0
@deviceId = dev-terminal-01
@username = owner
@password = password123

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Device-Id: {{deviceId}}

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Refresh token (paste refresh token from login response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
Device-Id: {{deviceId}}

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### Get current profile (paste access token from login response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
Device-Id: {{deviceId}}
Accept: application/json

